Z||000010||Rodney||08-01-2000||08:59 AM||||I have the new sub speakers on my new site. It should be up in a day or so. Sub speaker kit is $32 and $8 shipping. It is very heavy. Much heavier than the OEM speaker. Includes a new OEM grill foam gasket and a new die cut gasket to make the system an air tight fit with the new speaker installed. <P>My new site has lots of new stuff and most all with pictures. Maybe in a day or two it will be up and running! I'll post it when it is ready.<P>Rodney Dickman||||reg||1
